<title>USA: KSB Bancorp sets 3-for-1 stock split.</title>
<headline>KSB Bancorp sets 3-for-1 stock split.</headline>
<dateline>KINGFIELD, Maine 1997-06-20</dateline>
<text>
<p>KSB Bancorp Inc said Friday that it has declared a three-for-one stock split.</p>
<p>It will be paid July 10 as a 200 percent stock dividend to shareholders of record as of June 30, it said.</p>
<p>The company also declared a 20 percent increase in its regular cash dividend, paid July 10, record June 30. The dividend will be paid after giving effect to the stock split.</p>
<p>The new dividend equates to an annual dividend rate of $0.08 per share, the company said.</p>
</text>
